 400:Middlewares/LVGL/GUI/lvgl/src/draw/../misc/lv_color.h ****      *
 401:Middlewares/LVGL/GUI/lvgl/src/draw/../misc/lv_color.h ****      * Find the first divisor where ( adder >> divisor ) <= 0
