 412:Middlewares/LVGL/GUI/lvgl/src/draw/../misc/lv_color.h ****      * 6-bit to 8-bit: 255 = ( 63 * multiplier + adder ) >> divisor
 413:Middlewares/LVGL/GUI/lvgl/src/draw/../misc/lv_color.h ****      * divisor  multiplier  adder  min (0)  max (63)
 414:Middlewares/LVGL/GUI/lvgl/src/draw/../misc/lv_color.h ****      *       0           4      3        3       255
 415:Middlewares/LVGL/GUI/lvgl/src/draw/../misc/lv_color.h ****      *       1           8      6        3       255
